OL,3,GNEWSAMajor public safety operation over
OL,4,ADrumcree as NI secretary appeals for
OL,5,Acalm
OL,6,
OL,7,FA "major public safety operation" will
OL,8,Fcontinue in Portadown this weekend as
OL,9,Fthe Drumcree parade dispute continues.
OL,11,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,12,F(PSNI) said it was "continuing to seek
OL,13,Fsafe and peaceful compliance" with the
OL,14,FParades Commission's decision that the
OL,15,FOrange Order parade could go ahead with
OL,16,Frestrictions.
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,19,FBryant also called for calm and said
OL,20,F"everyone across Northern Ireland wants
OL,21,Fa peaceful resolution".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
