OL,3,GNEWSAMajor public safety operation over
OL,4,ADrumcree as NI secretary appeals for
OL,5,Acalm
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI Chief Constable
OL,8,Fsaid there would be an investigation
OL,9,Fafter protesters blocked the mainly
OL,10,Fnationalist road to prevent the parade
OL,11,Ffrom happening.
